process square⦅int64 x⦆ → int64 ⟦
    yield x ⊗ x ·
⟧

process add⦅int64 a⸴ int64 b⦆ → int64 ⟦
    yield a ⊕ b ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    int64 n ↦ 8 ·
    int64 sq ↦ square⦅n⦆ ·
    int64 total ↦ add⦅sq⸴ 10⦆ ·
    when total ≻ 30 ⟦
        emit "big" ·
    ⟧ otherwise ⟦
        emit "small" ·
    ⟧
    emit total ·
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬3⟭ t ↦ tensor⟬1.5⸴ 2.5⸴ 3.5⟭ ·
    float64 sum ↦ ∑ t ·
    emit sum ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧

